        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, natural gas, at CHP power plant
Translated name: Nutzwärme, Erdgas, ab KWK Kraftwerk
Included processes: Heat output at the plant gate. The dataset uses the average net efficiency of power plants in the region adjusted for co-generation (using allocation based on exergy content).

The average allocated fuel consumption is about 0.64 MJ/MJ heat ouput. The heat generation of this technology in the region is at about 130'000 TJ based on international energy statistics.

Geography: DE in 2022.
Technology: Average installed technology.

Production volume: 130'000 TJ

